            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. Regular part-time non-probationary employees who work on a holiday specified in Section 1 above, shall receive one and one-half (1-1/2) times their regular straight time pay for all hours worked plus additional straight time holiday pay equal to the actual hours worked on the holiday for up to eight (8) hours except as noted in the next paragraph.",
